 o dispositivi di protezione individuale possono trasformarsi rapidamente in situazioni pericolose. Imparate a riconoscere tempestivamente i pericoli e ad agire in modo sicuro.", "short_description": "Scoprite la sicurezza sul lavoro nell'edilizia in legno in modo virtuale e realistico: riconoscere i rischi tipici, reagire correttamente, senza alcun pericolo di lesioni. Imparate a evitare errori e a utilizzare in modo sicuro utensili e moduli."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Querformat.png", "id": "1735425970481901", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821696_1735425973815234_7026648888461368653_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=htNu6knZxw0Q7kNvwGg8msh&_nc_oc=AdoCExZ46qeq2mwcf9VyvPztAlxMwx3myu4lPVHjZUY8k0jxLxn92rau9x4l5t9tMZQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQVRAKLyagOpFJt5byCpPoJxEu206rC4xUM8jOeLjsSUA&oe=6B0B4323"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1404469407857988", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819845_1404469411191321_2374008257608234867_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KPLXrUViMKsQ7kNvwHEXarK&_nc_oc=Ado4GBN4CLMLCA3qc9GoQXdTWPxXbd9AQMDnJfSAw2iU0ucGXeV1pvDj4j8vX5RIUyk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQT-EkBr0lJcaPIEMwXaUniSsVnem9kxbiGfCKKXghdMSQ&oe=6B0B2F1D"}, {"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Hochformat.png", "id": "1138371601691473", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822307_1138371605024806_6545105809583793091_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vHQl-5E9xEYQ7kNvwF59pzR&_nc_oc=Adqg8umpZNuN_7yeDlkXMvNm8RdkYAflr7-0-rRZg34veAGj5apsyxoKTAooizdNRX0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQT1YiJoBsnV2ZSsNaMYNVs1wZ